@startuml UC-07: Notifikasi Alert Sensor Abnormal

title UC-07: Notifikasi Alert Sensor Abnormal\nSistem Smart Aquaponic

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C7BE5
    ActorBorderColor #2C7BE5
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    ActorBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    GroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
    GroupBorderColor #ADC8FF
}

participant "Node.js\nMQTT Listener"               as NODE
control     "NotificationController\n(API)"        as API
entity      "Sites <<database>>"                   as SiteDB
entity      "Notifications <<database>>"           as NotifDB
boundary    "Mail Server SMTP\n<<external>>"       as MAIL
actor       "User"                                 as User
boundary    "NotificationPage (UI)"                as UI
control     "NotificationController\n(Web)"        as WEB

== Alur Trigger: Sensor Melewati Threshold ==

note over NODE : Dipicu dari UC-03 (Sensor Data Flow)\nSaat nilai sensor < min OR > max threshold

NODE  ->  API : POST /api/sensor-alert\nHeader: X-Sensor-Alert-Secret: {secret}\nBody: {site_id, message: "Sensor X abnormal (Y unit)", type: "warning"}
activate API

' Validasi secret header
API   ->  API : config('services.sensor_alert.secret')

alt Secret Belum Dikonfigurasi
    API  -->  NODE : HTTP 503 {message: 'Secret belum dikonfigurasi'}
else Secret Ada
    API   ->  API : hash_equals(secret, request->header('X-Sensor-Alert-Secret'))
    alt Secret Tidak Cocok (Unauthorized)
        API  -->  NODE : HTTP 403 {message: 'Unauthorized'}
    else Secret Valid
        ' Validasi input body
        API   ->  API : validate({site_id: required|integer|exists:sites,\nmessage: required|string|max:1000,\ntype: nullable|in:info,warning,alert})

        alt Validasi Input Gagal
            API  -->  NODE : HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity
        else Input Valid
            ' Cari site beserta relasi user
            API   ->  SiteDB : Site::with('user')->find(site_id)
            activate SiteDB
            SiteDB -->  API  : Site dengan user-nya
            deactivate SiteDB

            alt Site Tidak Ditemukan
                API  -->  NODE : HTTP 404 {message: 'Site tidak ditemukan'}
            else Site Ada
                ' Anti-spam check: cegah notifikasi duplikat dalam 30 menit
                API   ->  NotifDB : Notification::where(site_id)\n->where(message, validated.message)\n->where(created_at >= now() - 30 menit)\n->exists()
                activate NotifDB
                NotifDB -->  API  : exists: true / false
                deactivate NotifDB

                alt Notifikasi Duplikat (Anti-Spam Aktif)
                    note over API : Notifikasi serupa sudah ada\ndalam 30 menit terakhir.\nAbaikan untuk mencegah spam.
                    API  -->  NODE : HTTP 200 {message:'Notification sent', created:false}
                else Notifikasi Baru (Belum Ada Duplikat)
                    ' Simpan notifikasi ke database
                    API   ->  NotifDB : Notification::create(\n{site_id, message, type: 'warning', is_read: false})
                    activate NotifDB
                    NotifDB -->  API  : Notification object tersimpan
                    deactivate NotifDB

                    API   ->  API : notification->load('site')

                    ' Kirim email ke pemilik site
                    API   ->  MAIL : Mail::to(site.user.email)\n->send(new NotificationMail(notification))
                    activate MAIL

                    alt Email Berhasil Terkirim
                        MAIL -->  API  : Email terkirim (success)
                        deactivate MAIL
                        API  -->  NODE : HTTP 200 {message:'Notification sent', created:true,\nnotification_id: X}

                        note over User : User menerima email alert\nbahwa sensor pada site-nya abnormal
                    else Email Gagal (SMTP Exception)
                        MAIL -->  API  : Throwable exception
                        API   ->  API  : report($e) — Log error ke sistem
                        API  -->  NODE : HTTP 202 {message:'Notification saved but email failed',\ncreated:true, notification_id:X, error:...}
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
end

deactivate API

== Alur: User Melihat Halaman Notifikasi ==

User  ->  UI  : GET /notifications
activate UI
UI    ->  WEB : index()
activate WEB

WEB   ->  WEB : auth()->user() — identifikasi role

alt Role: Admin
    WEB   ->  NotifDB : Notification::latest()->get()
    activate NotifDB
    NotifDB -->  WEB  : semua notifikasi
    deactivate NotifDB

    WEB   ->  NotifDB : Notification::where('is_read', false)\n->update(['is_read' => true])
    activate NotifDB
    NotifDB -->  WEB  : semua notifikasi ditandai telah dibaca
    deactivate NotifDB
else Role: User
    WEB   ->  NotifDB : user->sites->pluck('id') → siteIds
    activate NotifDB
    NotifDB -->  WEB  : site IDs milik user
    deactivate NotifDB

    WEB   ->  NotifDB : Notification::whereIn('site_id', siteIds)\n->latest()->get()
    activate NotifDB
    NotifDB -->  WEB  : notifikasi untuk site milik user
    deactivate NotifDB

    WEB   ->  NotifDB : Notification::whereIn('site_id', siteIds)\n->where('is_read', false)\n->update(['is_read' => true])
    activate NotifDB
    NotifDB -->  WEB  : notifikasi ditandai telah dibaca
    deactivate NotifDB
end

WEB  -->  UI  : view('notification', notifications)
deactivate WEB
UI   -->  User : Tampilkan daftar notifikasi (pesan, tipe, waktu, status baca)
deactivate UI

@enduml
